# The build context is web/, and the Dockerfiles copy whole app directories.
# Without these, a developer's node_modules — macOS binaries, links into a
# store the image does not have — lands over the image's own install, and a
# local .env is baked into the bundle by Vite.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
e2e/
